OL,3,CInfantino to hold crisis talks in
OL,4,CMorocco over Fifa investment
OL,5,Ccontroversy
OL,7,FGianni Infantino will host crisis
OL,8,Ftalks with Fifa officials in Morocco
OL,9,Fas pressure grows on him to quit, ITV
OL,10,FNews understands.
OL,12,FFifa sources told ITV News that
OL,13,FInfantino is in Rabat, Morocco's
OL,14,Fcapital, where a meeting of selected
OL,15,FFifa staff has been convened.
OL,17,FThe Fifa president has faced criticism
OL,18,Fover his plans to sell stakes in a
OL,19,FWorld Cup company to private
OL,20,Finvestors, a proposal he has since U-
OL,21,Fturned on.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
