FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785889101
OL,3,CInfantino to hold crisis talks in
OL,4,CMorocco over Fifa investment
OL,5,Ccontroversy
OL,7,FInfantino had proposed creating Fifa
OL,8,FForward Enterprise (FFE) and selling a
OL,9,F20% stake in it to private equity.
OL,11,FThe plans were rejected by three
OL,12,Fcontinental confederations, while Uefa
OL,13,Fthreatened to boycott the World Cup
OL,14,Fand other Fifa competitions if the
OL,15,Fproposal went ahead.
OL,17,FThe English Football Association and
OL,18,Fits Welsh counterpart also withdrew
OL,19,Fsupport for Infantino.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785889101
OL,3,CInfantino to hold crisis talks in
OL,4,CMorocco over Fifa investment
OL,5,Ccontroversy
OL,7,FInfantino rowed back on his plans on
OL,8,FSaturday, a decision which Fifa's
OL,9,Fchief of global football development,
OL,10,FArsene Wenger, said was "absolutely
OL,11,Fnecessary and beyond question".
OL,13,FThe former Arsenal manager said he was
OL,14,Fleft in the lurch and not involved in
OL,15,Fthe plans, only becoming aware of it
OL,16,Fthrough media reports.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
