FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785889101
OL,3,CInfantino to hold crisis talks in
OL,4,CMorocco over Fifa investment
OL,5,Ccontroversy
OL,7,FInfantino said: "Having listened
OL,8,Fcarefully to all the views, it has
OL,9,Fbecome clear that the project has
OL,10,Fcreated divisions of a nature that,
OL,11,Fregardless of the level of support,
OL,12,Fare no longer in the interest of the
OL,13,Fobjective set out in the first place."
OL,15,FHis senior advisor quit the
OL,16,Forganisation last week over the row.
OL,18,FThe Jordan Football Association was
OL,19,Fthe latest to criticise Fifa's
OL,20,Fleadership, accusing the football body
OL,21,Fof "blackmail" on Tuesday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
