OL,3,CInfantino to hold crisis talks in
OL,4,CMorocco over Fifa investment
OL,5,Ccontroversy
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FIn a statement on social media on
OL,13,FSaturday, Uefa welcomed the withdrawal
OL,14,Fof the FFE plan, but said it had "lost
OL,15,Fconfidence" in Infantino.
OL,17,F"The current Fifa leadership has not
OL,18,Fonly lost Uefa's confidence but also
OL,19,Fthat of many other members of the
OL,20,Ffootball family," the statement said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
