OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785889101
OL,3,CInfantino to hold crisis talks in
OL,4,CMorocco over Fifa investment
OL,5,Ccontroversy
OL,7,FThe European football governing body
OL,8,Fcriticised Infantino's lack of
OL,9,Ftransparency and "shabby, back-room,
OL,10,Fopaque deal" and said, "the task of
OL,11,Frebuilding trust in Fifa has only just
OL,12,Fbegun".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/6
